## Purpose
Baseline tools and environment activation required across the project.

## Applies When
- Project-wide context; attaches broadly to keep environment instructions handy.

## Stack
- Python 3.10+
- Lint/Format: Ruff
- Tests: pytest
- Env: conda (env name: `esm`)
- Data: pandas, numpy
- VCS: git (+ git-lfs for large checkpoints)

## Environment Activation
- `source ~/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate esm`
- Verify interpreter is from `esm` before running Python.
